rumc-map-diplomacy = Diplomacy
rumc-map-diplomacy-hint = A pact: neither pays extra in the regions of interest of the other, and neither may do the other harm. A harm breaks the pact in view of all and gives the victim the right to answer.
rumc-map-diplomacy-none = There are no other ambassadors yet.
rumc-map-pact-yes = a pact stands
rumc-map-pact-none = no pact
rumc-map-pact-sent = offer sent
rumc-map-pact-received = offers a pact
rumc-map-pact-propose = Offer a pact
rumc-map-pact-accept = Accept the pact
rumc-map-pact-break = Break it
